Bundled open-source components
------------------------------
* src/crypto1.c
    Port of "crapto1" — Crypto-1 cipher and LFSR key recovery.
    Copyright (C) 2008-2014 bla <blapost@gmail.com>
    Copyright (C) Proxmark3 contributors.
    GPLv3. Upstream: github.com/RfidResearchGroup/proxmark3 (common/crapto1).

* src/hardnested/
    Vendored "mfoc-hardnested" — Mifare hardnested solver (cmdhfmfhard.c,
    hardnested/*, crapto1.c, crypto1.c, parity, ui, util, bucketsort).
    Copyright (C) 2015 piwi and Proxmark3 / nfc-tools contributors.
    GPLv2-or-later / GPLv3. Upstream: github.com/nfc-tools/mfoc-hardnested.
    Decoupled from libnfc here: only the nonce-acquisition function was
    replaced by a PM-Pro collection hook; the solver is unchanged.

Original work
-------------
* All other source under src/ is original, written from the protocol
  description in PROTOCOL.md. PROTOCOL.md documents facts about the FURUI
  NFC PM-Pro (FR-RATEL) wire protocol determined by clean-room reverse
  engineering for interoperability. No decompiled vendor code is included in
  this repository.

